  "contract": "Single positive-edge clock; synchronous active-high reset flushes the queue. Transfers occur only with valid && ready outside reset. Output valid exactly matches nonempty occupancy. Input ready when capacity exists or a simultaneous output transfer frees space. Accepted payloads leave in FIFO order. Output remains valid and stable while stalled. No fall-through on an empty queue.",
